@startuml
title List Specialties

actor Admin
participant UI
participant SpecialtiesController
participant SpecialtyService
participant SpecialtyRepository
participant AutoMapper
database Database

== UI Request ==
Admin -> UI : 1. Click "View Specialties" or load specialties page
activate UI
UI -> SpecialtiesController : 2. HTTP GET /api/specialties (SpecialtyQueryRequest)
activate SpecialtiesController

== Service Call ==
SpecialtiesController -> SpecialtyService : 3. GetSpecialtiesAsync(SpecialtyQueryRequest)
activate SpecialtyService

== Query Specialties ==
SpecialtyService -> SpecialtyRepository : 4. GetSpecialtiesAsync(SpecialtyQueryRequest)
activate SpecialtyRepository
SpecialtyRepository -> Database : 5. SELECT * FROM Specialties\nWHERE (@searchTerm IS NULL OR Name LIKE '%' + @searchTerm + '%')\nAND (@status IS NULL OR Status = @status)\nORDER BY @sortBy @sortOrder\nOFFSET @offset ROWS FETCH NEXT @pageSize ROWS ONLY
activate Database
Database --> SpecialtyRepository : 6. List<SpecialtyEntity>
deactivate Database

SpecialtyRepository -> Database : 7. SELECT COUNT(*) FROM Specialties\nWHERE (@searchTerm IS NULL OR Name LIKE '%' + @searchTerm + '%')\nAND (@status IS NULL OR Status = @status)
activate Database
Database --> SpecialtyRepository : 8. TotalCount
deactivate Database
SpecialtyRepository --> SpecialtyService : 9. (List<SpecialtyEntity>, TotalCount)
deactivate SpecialtyRepository

== Map to DTOs ==
SpecialtyService -> AutoMapper : 10. Map((List<SpecialtyEntity>, TotalCount) → SpecialtyListResponse)
activate AutoMapper
AutoMapper --> SpecialtyService : 11. SpecialtyListResponse
deactivate AutoMapper

== Set Pagination Info ==
SpecialtyService -> SpecialtyService : 12. Set pagination info (PageNumber, PageSize, TotalPages)
activate SpecialtyService
deactivate SpecialtyService

SpecialtyService --> SpecialtiesController : 13. SpecialtyListResponse
deactivate SpecialtyService

SpecialtiesController --> UI : 14. HTTP 200 OK (SpecialtyListResponse)
deactivate SpecialtiesController

UI --> Admin : 15. Render specialties list on screen
deactivate UI

@enduml
